    "created_at": "2022-08-30T15:18:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-08-30T15:18:44Z",
    "body": "The browser doesn't cache the services, it is all done in the OS Bluetooth stack, so clearing the cache is OS-specific.\r\n\r\nIf the services don't actually change at runtime, I would suggest using the Database Hash characteristic (0x2B2A) instead of Services Changed characteristic or using a random Bluetooth address so that the OS cache is avoided altogether.",
